 🗳️ Welcome to Election Day! Tonight's cheat sheet .

 🏛️ The new Congress will be sworn in 61 days from now. 💥  Situational awareness: The U.S. launched small-scale defensive strikes targeting Iranians using surface-to-air missiles against U.S. assets in the Strait of Hormuz. Unlike earlier in the war, the strikes weren't announced. Get the latest . 

 Smart Brevity™ count: 1,487 words ... 5½ mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 
 
