 7. 📜 Time capsule 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 This historic Election Day, online and in print:

 This morning's New York Times homepage. Today's New York Times front page. Today's Washington Post front page. 📺 The MS NOW chyron writers dashed off these updates during President Trump's remarks yesterday at the Lincoln Memorial Reflecting Pool: "OVER 10 MINUTES INTO TRUMP'S 'CLOSING ARGUMENT' SPEECH, TRUMP STILL TALKING ABOUT REFLECTING POOL."

 "OVER 15 MINUTES INTO TRUMP'S 'CLOSING ARGUMENT' SPEECH, TRUMP STILL TALKING ABOUT REFLECTING POOL." "OVER 20 MINUTES INTO MIDTERM 'CLOSING ARGUMENT' SPEECH TRUMP YET TO MENTION THE ELECTION." 🦊 Fox News showed an aide handing Trump another Reflecting Pool photo with the chyron: "NOW: TRUMP SPEAKS ONE DAY BEFORE PIVOTAL MIDTERMS."

 
 
