 8. 🎧 1 fun thing: Election Day DJ 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 A DJ booth outside a polling spot in 2024. Photo: DJs at the Polls DJs are playing music at about 5,000 polling places across 24 states during this year's election, Axios San Antonio's Madalyn Mendoza writes. 

 The nonpartisan initiative, DJs at the Polls, started at a single Philadelphia polling site in 2009. It focuses on communities with historically low turnout and aims to draw young and first-time voters. In the San Antonio area alone, DJs will set up at 79 polling locations. Keep reading ... Get Axios Local : Newsletters in 43 cities. 

 
 
